<title>USA: Farallon group raises Strawbridge stake.</title>
<headline>Farallon group raises Strawbridge stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Farallon Capital Management LLC said Thursday it raised its stake in Strawbridge &amp; Clothier to 2,019,200 common shares, or 19.0 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 147,700 shares between January 14 and March 19 at prices ranging from $14.81 to $17.94 a share.</p>
</text>
